# Error Budget Governance Checklist

## Service-Level Tracking
- [ ] Define SLOs for each critical service
- [ ] Calculate monthly/quarterly error budget (minutes or % downtime)
- [ ] Set up automated dashboards (Grafana/Datadog)
- [ ] Alert when >50% of budget consumed mid-cycle

## Portfolio Aggregation
- [ ] Roll up error budgets across all services
- [ ] Visualize aggregate consumption in BI dashboards
- [ ] Flag systemic risk when >40% portfolio budget consumed

## Governance Interventions
- [ ] Freeze feature rollouts for services breaching thresholds
- [ ] Allocate reliability engineers to high-consumption services
- [ ] Escalate to leadership when portfolio risk exceeds threshold
- [ ] Document interventions in Jira/Confluence

## Communication & Transparency
- [ ] Notify stakeholders via Slack/Teams when thresholds breached
- [ ] Share portfolio error budget status in quarterly reviews
- [ ] Publish postmortem for services exceeding error budget

## Post-Incident Follow-Up
- [ ] Review error budget consumption trends
- [ ] Adjust SLOs if consistently breached or too lenient
- [ ] Update governance playbook with lessons learned
